MassCubeX
Copyright 2026 MassCubeX contributors

Derived from Philipbear/masscube, commit
356748ede691862b9a87f67812db5e728a703b9d (upstream MassCube by Huaxu Yu).
MassCubeX replaces the processing implementation with streaming mzML/mzXML
MS1 extraction, profile mass detection, compiled numerical kernels, adaptive
local noise estimation, MS/MS provenance, MS2-seeded features with raw-MS1
gap filling, robust per-polarity parameter estimation, physical-time segmentation,
and default-on candidate ion relationships,
and a configurable per-file TSV command-line workflow. Packaging and documentation have been rewritten;
vendor readers, alignment, annotation, statistics, and plotting are removed.
The original Apache License 2.0 and attribution above are retained.
